        <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" vertex="1" value="SCOPE / EVIDENCE&#10;Source: deploy/production-cloud/k8s-production.py (manifests, public_ports, FILES) and README.md. Configuration review only; live cluster not inspected.&#10;This profile uses hostPort + hostPath and disables Traefik / ServiceLB. It does not use Ingress, StatefulSets or PVCs. Host ports come from deployment config.&#10;Cloudflare and the existing origin proxy are retained from the original topology; verify their live route/TLS settings. Blue arrows = communication; dashed arrow = management.&#10;All cards contain Kubernetes Service + Pod + Container. Deployment ownership and hostPath mounts are stated as annotations to keep the traffic view readable." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontColor=#18283b;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;">
